This design also includes offline message queuing and retransmission strategies to handle intermittent connectivity issues. It integrates with multiple cloud-based storage solutions, external identity providers, and real-time notification services, maintaining data consistency and integrity across systems.

The code is designed to be scalable, resilient, and fault-tolerant, with self-healing mechanisms for automatic detection and resolution of issues. It includes comprehensive error handling and logging mechanisms to trace request flows and identify bottlenecks.

Note that this is a high-level design and may require additional implementation details depending on specific requirements and constraints.']

